cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "EvidVar: Evidence-Gated Bayesian Fusion of Literature and Genomic Annotations for BRCA1/BRCA2 Variant Interpretation"
authors:
  - family-names: "Suresh"
    given-names: "Abhijith"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-20
repository-code: "https://github.com/abhijithsureshofficial-wq/evidvar"
abstract: >
  EvidVar is a reproducible NLP and probabilistic genetics pipeline for
  interpreting BRCA1/BRCA2 germline variants by fusing structured genomic
  annotations from ClinVar and Ensembl with sentence-level evidence mined
  from PubMed literature.
keywords:
  - bioinformatics
  - variant interpretation
  - natural language processing
  - ClinVar
  - PubMed
  - BRCA1
  - BRCA2
license: MIT
